id: pm-gh1385
title: "GH-1385: preserve literal annotation prefixes across comment input transports"
description: "Positional comments lose a literal TDD: prefix while explicit add preserves it. Preserve exact evidence text across positional, flag, file and stdin transports and retain explicit structured text input."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[4]: agent-ux,context-management,evidence-integrity,github-intake
created_at: "2026-10-04T03:29:32.435Z"
