comments[9]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-04T03:29:32.435Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check October 4: strict full all-status corpus read includes 2869/2869 records, complete with no omissions or unreadable records. Exact issue 1385, TDD prefix, positional prefix and comment shorthand searches plus full live pm-cvwi and pm-k0mr metadata show no existing leaf for literal prefix loss. Closed compatibility work remains completed; this new recurrence preserves its contract."
  "2026-10-04T03:34:14.850Z","harness:codex","TDD baseline reproduced in a fresh isolated tracker: positional TDD: prefix proof stored prefix proof, while explicit --add preserved TDD: prefix proof. SDK bootstrap bare-key normalization fuzzily matches TDD to add. Preserve literal annotation bodies while retaining documented explicit structured input and option spelling compatibility."
  "2026-10-04T03:51:26.897Z","harness:codex","TDD: 137 focused tests pass, including real annotation CLI transports, declared help recovery, stable history corruption, cache preservation and lock contention. All three isolated safe controls pass; restoring each unsafe invariant fails its selected behavior assertion. No source coverage exclusions or threshold changes. Full-source coverage and static release gates are now running before closure."
  "2026-10-04T04:03:25.773Z","harness:codex","Linked-test configuration correction: the none PM-context mode correctly refused source-workspace execution before invoking the command. Retained that immutable refusal evidence and replaced the link through the CLI with schema isolation. The regression controller itself copies source into a disposable workspace and runs the canonical isolated test runner. No trust, isolation or failure gate was relaxed."
  "2026-10-04T06:12:14.826Z","harness:codex","Pre-closure recurrence gate caught two unregistered members in the truthful pm-cvwi -> pm-gh1385 recurrence lineage. The typed edge is retained. Existing families were read completely; none owns literal annotation bootstrap normalization. Register this specific recurrence with the actual regression and disposable source-mutant controller, unchanged zero escape budget, required static/coverage/Windows checks, and the fully read historical predecessor. Earlier failed gate remains a failed receipt; registration proof will be rerun before closure."
  "2026-10-04T06:27:13.480Z","harness:codex","Whole staged-fixture coverage completed with all 9686 cases passing and two Windows-only skips, but correctly failed exact coverage at branches50966/50967. The uncovered fallback was unreachable: normalizeBootstrapTokens has one call site, always supplied the string returned by resolvePmCommandOperation (including the empty-string root operation). Narrowed this private parameter to its actual string contract and removed the redundant nullish fallback; no source exclusion or test-only private injection is used. The source-mutant selector is updated to the actual condition, and whole coverage will be measured again."
  "2026-10-04T08:10:20.412Z","harness:codex","TDD: final all-source coverage passed unchanged exact gates: 9686 tests passed, 2 Windows-only skips on Linux; lines=63515/63515, statements=66625/66625, functions=13761/13761, branches=50965/50965. Zero uncovered counts across every measured source file. Focused real regressions, unsafe-source controls, linked execution and temporary Node/Bun/npm/npx/bunx acceptance passed. Implementation, closure and package-owned changelog are carried on the same delivery branch; published 2026.10.4 predates this change."
  "2026-10-04T09:21:54.840Z","harness:codex","Local review verification: unchanged agent-task token gate passed all nine completed tasks at 13837 tokens after a reversible disk relocation of this run's generated 10000-item fixture; all 10014 file SHA-256 values were preserved and the original temporary path remains a symlink. A delegating filesystem observer confirmed errno -122 (EDQUOT) on lock-owner writes. No host quota or gate budget was changed. Local SDK import timing remains environment-sensitive: Node 26 bare floor135>106ms and Node24 merge231>226ms; the unchanged hosted required gate will determine exact-head admission. Tracker assurance47/47, gate registry and public SDK surface pass."
  "2026-10-04T10:30:32.603Z","harness:codex","Review-fix closeout uses verified functional evidence: focused behavior43/43, primary linked SDK/core42/42, six executable source controls, temporary Node/Bun acceptance and20/20 standalone cases from the two local timing-failure files. The whole local current-source run had9687 passes, two timing failures and two Windows-only skips; it produced no valid coverage summary. The hosted exact-head complete source suite and100/100/100/100 gate remain mandatory admission checks before merge. No current-source global coverage claim, waiver, threshold change or timeout change is made. PR #1387 carries this closeout and its package-owned changelog in the same implementation delivery."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-04T04:08:58.576Z","harness:codex","Evidence text must not be treated as option syntax merely because a colon prefix resembles a flag or fuzzy alias. Public bootstrap normalization and real CLI input transports carry distinct risks, so the regression owner proves both while retaining explicit SDK text-prefix syntax."
